---
import { storyImage } from '../data/gallery';
---
<section class="block" id="story">
  <div class="story wrap">
    <div class="copy reveal">
      <div class="label">The Cabin</div>
      <h2 class="display">A quiet line between forest and meadow.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Built in the Scandinavian-modern tradition — clean wood, floor-to-ceiling glass, a gas fireplace that anchors the great room. Mornings here are long, deliberate things: coffee on the deck, the meadow still in fog, the smell of pine just past the door.</p>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top: 20px;">Inside Suncadia Resort, with full access to the Swim &amp; Fitness Center, Prospector and Rope Rider golf, Glade Spring Spa, and the trails that thread through six thousand acres of the eastern Cascades.</p>
    </div>
    <img class="reveal" src={storyImage} alt="Interior of the cabin with fireplace and warm wood" loading="lazy" />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 5fr 7fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .story .copy { padding-right: 24px; }
  .story img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .story { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
    .story .copy { padding-right: 0; }
  }
</style>
